{"5130880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Digbound", "steam_appid": 5130880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130880/extras/343ad07050705fb8669529cf492172d6.avif?t=1787926426\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digbound</strong> is a first-person mining game with incremental progression about one simple thing: <strong>digging deeper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your shovel, break through the ground, and uncover increasingly valuable ores hidden beneath the surface. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell what you find, upgrade your equipment, and return stronger to reach depths you couldn't before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your inventory, increase your digging power, improve your tools, and unlock powerful upgrades that transform the way you mine. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the tougher the ground becomes but the rewards get bigger too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig. Sell. Upgrade. Dig deeper. </strong>  <br>  <br>How far down can you go?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130880/extras/343ad07050705fb8669529cf492172d6.avif?t=1787926426\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digbound</strong> is a first-person mining game with incremental progression about one simple thing: <strong>digging deeper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab yo